    <question_explanation no="8" id="PRB-976E7422889A239E-Q8">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 자동사와 타동사의 쓰임이 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>자동사와</keyword>
        <keyword>타동사</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>先生を迎えるために空港に車を&lt;u&gt;止めました&lt;/u&gt;。</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 일어 · 자동사와 타동사
정답은 ④이다. 목적어 車を와 함께 쓰므로 타동사 止める(세우다)의 止めました가 옳다. コップを는 割って, 電気を는 消しました, 背が는 伸びました로 해야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>手が滑ってコップを&lt;u&gt;割れて&lt;/u&gt;しまいました。</choice_text>
          <commentary>타동사 割る를 써야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>節約のために電気を&lt;u&gt;消えました&lt;/u&gt;。</choice_text>
          <commentary>타동사 消す를 써야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>いつのまにか子供の背が&lt;u&gt;伸ばしました&lt;/u&gt;。</choice_text>
          <commentary>자동사 伸びる를 써야 한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>先生を迎えるために空港に車を&lt;u&gt;止めました&lt;/u&gt;。</choice_text>
          <commentary>止めました이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
